<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><fdroid><repo icon="icon.png" name="Wiktionary Lookup" pubkey="" timestamp="1792707949" url="https://d33mobile.github.io/wiktionary-lookup-fdroid/repo" version="20002"><description>Offline dictionary for every language in English Wiktionary (via kaikki.org, CC BY-SA 4.0): Chinese built in, 467 languages downloadable in the app. Incremental search by headword, romanization or English.</description></repo><application id="pl.d33.wiktionary"><id>pl.d33.wiktionary</id><added>2026-10-22</added><lastupdated>2026-10-22</lastupdated><name>Wiktionary Lookup</name><summary>Offline dictionary for any Wiktionary language, with English definitions</summary><desc>An offline dictionary built from English Wiktionary. Results update on
every keystroke; search by headword, by romanization (pinyin for Chinese,
with or without tone digits) or by English words in the definitions. Tap a
result to see all of its senses. The speaker button plays the Wiktionary
recording when there is one (from Wikimedia Commons, cached on the device)
and otherwise reads the word with the system text-to-speech voice.

Chinese (about 190,000 entries) ships inside the APK and works without
network access. Every other language that English Wiktionary covers can be
downloaded from the language menu; the indexes are hosted as GitHub release
assets of https://github.com/d33mobile/wiktionary-lookup-data and are kept
on the device after download.

